# CORS Configuration Reviewer Rule v2.0 STRICT

**Do not inline-audit.** Invoke **`cors_reviewer`** -> `.cursor/agents/cors_reviewer.md`.

| Artifact | Path |
|---|---|
| Policy | `.cursor/skills/cors_reviewer/POLICY.md` |
| Scan skill | `.cursor/skills/cors_reviewer/SKILL.md` |
| Report path | `AI/cors_reviewer/cors_reviewer_report.md` |
| Report line | `cors_reviewer v2.0 STRICT` |

**POLICY.md wins.**

## Non-negotiable rules

1. **`allowedOrigins("*")` with `allowCredentials(true)` is always FAIL (CORS01).**
2. **Any wildcard origin is FAIL (CORS09), even without credentials.**
3. **Dev/tunnel hostnames in CORS allow-lists are FAIL in every profile (CORS08).**
4. **Reflecting `Origin` without allow-list validation is always FAIL (CORS02).**

Allowed verdicts: **PASS**, **FAIL**, **MANUAL_REVIEW**, **N/A**.
